000021C *> 26/11/25 vbc - Added new field PY-PR2-Last-Employee-no - filler adjusted.
000022C *> 28/11/25 vbc - Added new field PY-PR1-Tax-ID  to ident employer with IRS set
000023C *>                as x(24) as format not known.
000024C *> 09/03/26 vbc - PR2 fields changed from x to bin-short unsigned.
000025C *> 27/03/26 vbc - Just-closed-year-ended chg unsign bin to x (Y/N)
000026C *> 12/04/26 vbc - New fields added see note at end of copybook.
000027C *>
000028C  01  PY-Param1-Record.
000029C      03  PY-PR1-Block.                         *> Size = 906
000030C          05  PY-PR1-Company-Data.                 *> size 300
000031C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Name       pic x(60). *> Applewood Computers  [ 60 ] ?
000032C              07  PY-PR1-Trade-Name    pic x(32).
000033C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Address-1  pic x(32). *> 17 Stag Green Avenue [ 30 ]
000034C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Address-2  pic x(32). *> Hatfield             [ 30 ]
000035C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Address-3  pic x(32). *> Hertfordshire        [ 30 ]
000036C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Address-4  pic x(32). *> spaces
000037C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Post-Code.
000038C                  09  PY-PR1-Co-Zip    pic x(10).
000039C                  09  PY-PR1-Co-State  pic xx.
000040C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Phone      pic x(12). *> 01234-123456
000041C              07  PY-PR1-Co-Email      pic x(30). *> vbcoen@gmail.com
