003154   zz070-Convert-Date          section.
003155  *>**********************************
003156  *>
003157  *>  Converts date in To-Day to UK/USA/Intl date format using ACAS param
003158  *>*********************************************************************
003159  *> Input:   To-Day
003160  *> output:  WS-Date as uk/US/Inlt date format
003161  *>
003162       move     To-Day to WS-Date.
003163  *>
003164       if       Date-Form = zero
003165                move 1 to Date-Form.
003166       if       Date-UK
003167                go to zz070-Exit.
003168       if       Date-USA                *> Swap month and days
003169                move WS-Days  to WS-Swap
003170                move WS-Month to WS-Days
003171                move WS-Swap  to WS-Month
003172                go to zz070-Exit.
003173  *>
003174  *> So its International date format
003175  *>
003176       move     "ccyy/mm/dd" to WS-Date.  *> Swap Intl to UK form
003177       move     To-Day (7:4) to WS-Intl-Year.
003178       move     To-Day (4:2) to WS-Intl-Month.
003179       move     To-Day (1:2) to WS-Intl-Days.
003180  *>
003181   zz070-Exit.
003182       exit     section.
